[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0537","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0537.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0685","title":"BEA WebLogic PageCompileServlet 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"BEA WebLogic 服务器 PageCompileServlet 存在未授权访问漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可直接调用该 Servlet 编译并执行任意 JHTML 代码，导致远程命令执行。该漏洞影响 WebLogic 3.1.8、4.0.4、4.5.1 及 5.1.x 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。厂商已发布安全公告，建议升级至不受影响版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0685"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:15.920","remediation":"升级 BEA WebLogic Server 至 5.1.x 之后的安全版本（如 6.0 及以上），或部署 BEA 官方安全公告 (Security Alert 000731) 提供的补丁。如无法升级，在 web.xml 中移除 PageCompileServlet 映射或添加 security-constraint 限制访问；也可在 Apache/IIS 反向代理层屏蔽对 /servlet/PageCompileServlet 路径的请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0434.html","http://developer.bea.com/alerts/security_000731.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1525","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20125","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0685.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0685","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0685.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0685.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cxwh-v9vc-654w/GHSA-cxwh-v9vc-654w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f6d7278e-00cf-4729-92dc-92db9b97848f.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0685.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0537.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0537.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0536","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0536.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0684","title":"BEA WebLogic JSPServlet 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"BEA WebLogic 5.1.x 的 JSPServlet 存在访问控制缺陷，远程攻击者无需认证即可直接调用该 Servlet 编译执行任意 JSP 源文件，从而在服务器上执行任意 Java 代码，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 BEA WebLogic 5.1.x 全版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。厂商已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0684"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:15.797","remediation":"立即将 BEA WebLogic Server 升级至 5.1.0 SP8 或更高版本，该版本修复了 JSPServlet 未正确限制访问权限的问题，阻止远程攻击者直接调用 Servlet 编译任意源文件。如无法立即升级，可在 web.xml 中通过 security-constraint 限制对 /servlet/* 路径的访问，仅允许受信任用户或内部网络调用，同时使用反向代理在网络层过滤对 JSPServlet 的直接请求。此外，禁用服务器上未使用的 JSP 编译功能，并确保普通用户无法上传任意文件至可被 Servlet 访问的目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0434.html","http://developer.bea.com/alerts/security_000731.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1525","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20081","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0684.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0684","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf534