性校验，攻击者可通过搭建恶意的 CVS 服务器，向连接到的客户端发送特制的文件路径信息，强制客户端在本地创建任意文件，可能导致恶意文件植入或系统文件覆盖。该漏洞影响 CVS 1.10.8 及更早版本，危害等级较低，攻击者需诱导用户连接恶意 CVS 服务器。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0679"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:15.130","remediation":"升级 CVS 客户端至 1.11 或更高版本，该版本不再盲目信任服务端返回的文件路径；仅连接可信任的 CVS 服务端；使用 SSH 隧道加密 CVS 通信，避免中间人攻击；如条件允许，建议迁移至 Git 等现代版本控制系统。如无法升级，可配置本地文件系统权限，限制 CVS 客户端运行账户的写入范围作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1523","http://www.securityfocus.com/frames/?content=/templates/archive.pike%3Flist%3D1%26msg%3Dhvou2daoebb.fsf%40serein.m17n.org","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20107","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ac21ad6117514c2d2073c3d7d77e898bf2697d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0679.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0679.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0679","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0679.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0679.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f2ea71c23456d0bc766953e4ba2672b9cace7c4f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0679.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d93d9a5e495c1795f8af05fa5925caaf6a38cde1/2000/CVE-2000-0679.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0679.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0679.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/d6b0e37a6bdfbcb1582ab9fe7c1f8d2381a5c6b8/api/2000/CVE-2000-0679.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0533.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0370","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0370.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0360","title":"ISC INN 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"INN（InterNetNews）新闻服务器 2.2.1 及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的新闻组文章（article）触发该漏洞，导致服务器进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 INN 2.2.1 及之前版本的系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，危害等级中等。建议升级至 INN 2.2.2 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0360"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:33.303","remediation":"升级 INN 至 2.2.2 或更高版本。Caldera OpenLinux 用户安装 CSSA-1999-038 补丁包，SuSE Linux 用户应用 suse_security_announce_34 更新。临时缓解措施：在防火墙限制对 NNTP 端口（119/tcp）的访问，仅允许可信来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_34.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1249","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0360.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0360","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0360.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0360.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b21976b5bf1b11783559cbe4f375f11636b79518/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-w2p4-fvrc-29cj/GHSA-w2p4-fvrc-29cj.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/inn_buff_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/scipag/AttackToolKit/blob/78bf88564956b8f18a37659dc3d345093e95a136/plugins/ISC%20INN%20prior%202.2.2%20news%20articles%20buffer%20overflows.plugin","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0360.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0370.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0029","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0031","title":"Red Hat Linux initscripts 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 的 initscripts 初始化脚本包中存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建恶意的符号链接文件，诱使 initscripts 在处理临时文件时以 root 权限执行任意文件操作，从而将自身权限提升至 root。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 多个版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0031"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:51.573","remediation":"立即升级 initscripts 软件包至 5.00-1 或更高版本（Red Hat Linux 6.x 对应 RHSA-2000:001 安全公告）。脚本中应使用 mktemp 创建临时文件而非固定路径，避免 /tmp 目录下的符号链接劫持。如无法升级，移除 initscripts 中写入 /tmp 的可疑临时文件操作作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0031","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0031.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0031.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0031","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/70a2e67cf4b780574379fe6685466348a1f2340b/2000/CVE-2000-0031.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0031.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0031.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88243/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/ee86c26ee0202761283d7d612909ed4cc8981bf7/2000.tsv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0031.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0002","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0760","title":"Apache Tomcat Snoop Servlet 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 3.0/3.1 中的 Snoop Servlet 存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送带有 `.snp` 扩展名的不存在 URL 请求，触发 Snoop Servlet 返回系统环境变量、系统属性、请求参数等敏感信息。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，可能导致攻击者获取服务器内部配置信息，为进一步攻击提供情报。影响 Jakarta Tomcat 3.0 和 3.1 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0760"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:25.440","remediation":"升级到 Tomcat 4.0 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，删除 `$CATALINA_HOME/conf/web.xml` 中 snoop servlet 的映射配置，或通过防火墙限制对 `*.snp` 路径的外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1532","http://www.securityfocus.com/frames/?content=/templates/archive.pike%3Flist%3D1%26date%3D2000-07-15%26msg%3DPine.SUN.3.96.1000719235404.24004A-100000%40grex.cyberspace.org","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20132","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2000/CVE-2000-0760.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0760.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2000/CVE-2000-0760.yaml","https:/