s":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0310.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1630","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0687.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0687","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0687.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0687.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pqf9-f88f-jphj/GHSA-pqf9-f88f-jphj.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0687.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1500.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0882","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0882.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0730","title":"HP HP-UX newgrp 命令本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.0 系统中的 newgrp 命令存在权限提升漏洞。该命令在处理用户组切换操作时未能正确验证用户权限，导致本地攻击者可通过执行特制的 newgrp 命令获取更高权限。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用该漏洞可提升至其他用户或组的权限，进而执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 11.0 版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0730"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20","updated":"2000-10-20","remediation":"建议升级 HP-UX 11.0 至最新补丁包，或安装 HP 官方发布的 newgrp 安全补丁。如无法立即升级，可临时移除 newgrp 的 setuid 权限：chmod u-s /usr/bin/newgrp，以消除本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0144.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1580","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0730.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0730","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0730.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0730.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j48w-866x-v5fr/GHSA-j48w-866x-v5fr.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0730.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/a3d797a054f33a26fc99648a4e1cc47b2bce8d08/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0882.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0873","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0873.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0719","title":"VariCAD 文件覆盖漏洞","description":"VariCAD 7.0 安装程序在安装过程中将程序文件设置为全局可写权限，导致本地攻击者可将正常程序替换为特洛伊木马程序。当其他用户（包括管理员）执行被替换的程序时，木马将以该用户权限运行，从而实现权限提升或系统控制。该漏洞利用条件为攻击者拥有本地访问权限，CVSS v2.0 评分 6.2，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0719"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20","updated":"2000-10-20","remediation":"立即检查 VariCAD 7.0 安装目录（通常为 /usr/local/variCAD/ 或 /opt/variCAD/）下所有文件的权限，使用 `chmod -R o-w` 移除其他用户的写权限，确保仅 root 或 VariCAD 运行用户可写。如厂商已发布更新版本，请升级至不受影响的版本；若无法升级，建议使用 `chmod 755` 设置目录权限，并定期审计文件完整性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0719.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0719","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0719.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0719.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h97q-x4cw-q828/GHSA-h97q-x4cw-q828.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1862/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0719.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/1e58254e5bdaf937b4bd41c6a50d0d633bef0eb7/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--619fda22-e4d4-4f4a-ad89-7178c714945f.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0873.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0867","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0867.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0712","title":"LIDS Linux Intrusion Detection System 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux Intrusion Detection System (LIDS) 0.9.7 存在权限许可和访问控制漏洞。当系统以 security=0 启动选项关闭 LIDS 保护机制时，本地攻击者可利用该缺陷绕过 LIDS 的访问控制限制，获取 root 超级用户权限。攻击者需要拥有系统的本地登录权限，通过修改引导参数或利用系统已存在的不安全配置即可完成权限提升，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0712"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 LIDS 至 0.9.8 或更高版本，该版本修复了通过 security=0 启动参数绕过 LIDS 权限控制的问题。同时配置 GRUB 密码保护以防止未授权用户修改内核启动参数，并限制物理控制台访问权限。作为临时缓解措施，可移除 /boot/grub/grub.conf 中不必要的 security= 参数并设置 grub 密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0486.html","http://www.egroups.com/message/lids/1038","http://www.lids.org/changelog.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1495","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1549","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0712.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0712","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0712.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0712.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vxcx-7p8x-jr3r/GHSA-vxcx-7p8x-jr3r.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0712.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--387596fe-4c4f-4f2f-b82e-ed8a47d53539.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0867.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0601","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0601.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0799","title":"SGI IRIX 6.5.x InPerson inpview 竞态条件漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.5.x 系统中的 InPerson 视频会议工具中的 inpview 程序存在竞态条件漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp 目录下创建符号链接，利用该程序在处理临时文件时的竞态条件，以提升的权限覆盖或破坏系统任意文件，从而实现权限提升。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，且无需交互即可触发该漏洞。该漏洞影响 IRIX 6.5.x 系列操作系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0799"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20","updated":"2000-10-20","remediation":"立即移除 /usr/lib/InPerson/inpview 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/lib/InPerson/inpview），并限制可执行权限为仅 root（chmod 700 /usr/lib/InPerson/inpview）。如不使用 InPerson 服务，建议直接卸载该软件包。SGI 已针对此漏洞发布安全补丁，请升级到 IRIX 6.5.x 的最新维护版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20130","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0799.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0799","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0799.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0799.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-f936-2fxc-65q4/GHSA-f936-2fxc-65q4.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c11aef1b-4943-4fa1-bde4-3971370f212b.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0799.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0601.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0601.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0601.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0579","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0579.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0759","title":"Apache Tomcat 3.1 路径显示漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 3.1 版本存在路径泄露漏洞，攻击者可通过发送特制 HTTP 请求（如访问不存在的 JSP 文件或触发错误页面）导致服务器在错误响应中返回内部文件系统的绝对路径信息。该漏洞影响 Apache Tomcat 3.1 及早期版本，远程未经身份认证的攻击者即可利用，无需特殊权限。攻击者可利用泄露的路径信息进一步探测目录结构、定位敏感文件或配合其他漏洞实施攻击，属于信息泄露类漏洞，CVSS 评分通常为中等级别（约 5.0 分）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0759"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20","updated":"2000-10-20","remediation":"升级到 Apache Tomcat 3.2 或更高版本以修复路径泄露问题。如无法升级，可在 Tomcat 的 web.xml 中禁用目录列表（将 listings 参数设为 false），并通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）过滤包含异常路径特征的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20131","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0759.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0759.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0759","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/maven/org.apache.tomcat/tomcat/CVE-2000-0759.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/GHSA/data/2000/CVE-2000-0759.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/github-reviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qg4g-6jcq-rw93/GHSA-qg4g-6jcq-rw93.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0759.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0759.md","https://github.com/p0dalirius/ApacheTomcatScanner/blob/af5077ce3aeae4c7df3be909998bb54e3812c742/apachetomcatscanner/data/vulnerabilities/2000/CVE-2000-0759.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/vulnerabilities/blob/e2e26e9752f48c74445ee914f9b937effce2fc7c/cves/tomcat/CVE-2000-0759.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0579.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0579.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0579.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0549","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0549.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0698","title":"Minicom 捕获文件符号链接攻击本地提权漏洞","description":"Minicom 1.82.1 及更早版本存在符号链接攻击漏洞。minicom 在处理 Capture（捕获）文件功能时，未对文件路径进行充分验证，本地攻击者可通过预先创建符号链接指向目标系统文件，诱使以 uucp 用户权限运行的 minicom 进程向任意文件写入数据。攻击者利用此漏洞可在受影响系统上创建或覆盖任意文件，进而实现本地权限提升或破坏系统完整性。该漏洞攻击复杂度较低，但需要攻击者拥有本地访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0698"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Minicom 至 1.83.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 capture 文件功能中的符号链接问题。如无法升级，应避免在多用户环境中使用 minicom 的 -C 参数指定捕获文件，或限制 uucp 组的文件写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/77361","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1599","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5151","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20160"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0549.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0547","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0547.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0697","title":"Solaris AnswerBook2 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Solaris AnswerBook2 中的 dwhttpd Web 服务器管理接口存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在请求参数中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）绕过输入过滤，在服务器上以 Web 进程权限执行任意系统命令。未经身份认证的攻击者无需任何前置条件即可远程利用该漏洞，完全控制受影响的 Solaris 系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0697"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20","updated":"2000-10-20","remediation":"立即安装 Sun 发布的补丁 110011-02 (SPARC) 或 110012-02 (x86)，将 AnswerBook2 升级到 v1.4.2 或更高版本。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙上限制对端口 8888 的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，或临时禁用 AnswerBook2 服务以消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/sun/2000-q3/0001.html","http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2000/Aug/0105.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1556","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20146"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0547.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0547.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0547.toml"}]